  "scope": "For every integer K>=1, put c=10K+1 and S_K={4,6,c}. Under the Sprague-Grundy recurrence and the period-first least-period/least-preperiod convention fixed in source.md and problem.md, the sequence G_{S_K} has least eventual period p=5 and, for that period, least preperiod q=2c+5=20K+7.",
